From e55251f4e93012f455c0e6cf324732f2c32f0936 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Blot <emmanuel.blot@free.fr>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 18:04:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 669/705] hw/arm/aspeed: use the TMP421 type-name macros

Include the new tmp421.h and refer to the sensor variants through
TYPE_TMP421/TYPE_TMP422/TYPE_TMP423 instead of open-coded string
literals and per-board local defines.

Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Blot <emmanuel.blot@free.fr>
---
